# AWS Talos security-review engagement metadata. Untracked — kept only as a
# local file — so the git-mirror publish never carries it to the public
# aws-samples repo. If your Talos review runs on a fresh clone rather than your
# local checkout, re-add it to the internal repo ONLY with `git add -f .secreview`.
.secreview
